{100}{}{Trish}
{200}{}{You see Trish, a waitress from the Skum Pitt.}
{210}{}{You see a waitress.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Trish0]}
{2000}{}{What the hell are you doing in my room?}
{2010}{}{Gug!}
{2020}{}{Whoops, sorry. I thought this was my room.}
{2030}{}{Sorry. Bye.}
{3000}{}{No way! I'm not into that! Go talk to Sinthia down the hall. She might be available, but
she is never free.}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{Yeah, right. Whatever. This is my room. Get the hell out.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{Hey, I met you at the Skum Pitt. What the hell are you doing in my room?}
{5010}{}{Plato}
{5020}{}{I wanted to get a closer look at you.}
{5030}{}{I wanted to get some info from you, and I didn't want to do it in front of that
bartender.}
{6000}{}{Just leave me alone.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Just leave me the hell alone, you loser. Sinthia might be your kind of woman, but I sure
as hell ain't.}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{You should leave me alone. I really don't want to talk to you.}
{8010}{}{Sorry to disturb you.}
{9000}{}{You got my boyfriend killed. I should hate you, but I knew it was going to happen sooner
or later. Please leave me alone.}
{9010}{}{[Done.]}
{10000}{}{What the hell are you doing in my room?}
{10010}{}{Grub!}
{10020}{}{Whoops, sorry. I thought this was my room.}
{10030}{}{Do you know a guy named Saul?}
{11000}{}{I used to think so. Now, I'm not so sure.}
{11010}{}{He really cares about you.}
{11020}{}{I think you should dump him.}
{12000}{}{So he says. If he did, he wouldn't be doing what he is doing.}
{12010}{}{What's that?}
{12020}{}{His boxing, right?}
{13000}{}{His fighting, of course. I don't get it.}
{13010}{}{Of course not, dearie.}
{13020}{}{It's a man thing.}
{14000}{}{Maybe you're right. Maybe I need to understand what he does and leave it at that.
---
Still, working for Gizmo is going to kill him.}
{14010}{}{[Done.]}
{15000}{}{Of course it's his boxing. He's a really nice guy, but he needs to get out of it before
it kills him.}
{15010}{}{Maybe that's what he wants to do.}
{16000}{}{You would say that. you want to take his place right?}
{16010}{}{Nah. You're too shanky.}
{16020}{}{Sure.}
{16030}{}{No, but you can't change him, and he can't change you. If you don't like what he does,
then you should look elsewhere.}
